<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka Hayleys up 10 pct on volume.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka Hayleys up 10 pct on volume.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Hayleys Ltd rose 10 percent or 20 rupees to 220 in early Thursday trade on turnover of 80,000 shares, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The investor was prepared to pay a premium for quantity,&quot; said a local broker who declined to be identified.</p>
<p>&quot;We could get only 200 shares at any price below 220,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>Hayleys is one of three blue chip conglomerates listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
